{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】上水一名地盤工人懷疑失平衡跌倒，遭鐵枝插傷下顎。</p>\n<p>受傷地盤工人獲救後，送到威爾斯親王醫院。</p>\n<p>警方早上10時許接報，清曉路一名工人在一個地盤工作時懷疑失平衡跌倒，下顎遭鐵枝插中。消防到場將鐵枝鋸斷，協助將工人救出。警方通知勞工處跟進調查。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:46:21.831027+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:14:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:17.454168+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:39:56.615861+00:00","content_hash":"62d0d82e2477248884216ffa7bbc5501d9196c60a8c895121dfdb32ccf3ef391","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:46:21.831027+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}